# Agent tooling — the published project is agent-agnostic; no agent-vendor
# specific file is tracked. The globs below are character-class spellings so
# this file names no vendor either; they are deliberately broad and match any
# case, so any file whose name references that tooling stays untracked.
.mcp.json
*[Cc][Ll][Aa][Uu][Dd][Ee]*
*[Aa][Nn][Tt][Hh][Rr][Oo][Pp][Ii][Cc]*
